---
// src/components/AboutSection.astro
---

<div class="aboutCard">
  <div class="about-topline">
    <span class="about-kicker"><span class="kicker-spark">✦</span> A LITTLE ABOUT ME</span>
    <span class="availability"><i></i> Working since Jan 2026</span>
  </div>

  <p class="about-copy">
    Hello, I'm <strong class="name-text">Deepali</strong> and I mostly go around by the name <span class="accent-text">lavenderpeaches</span>. I like to code and build things in general and have been programming since the fall of 2022. I love nerding out on latest technology, watching F1 and consuming brainrot. Currently, I'm working as a <span class="subtle-text">backend dev</span> at a startup and looking for opportunities to grow. I also love making <span class="accent-text">“That’s what she said”</span> jokes, playing <span class="accent-text">Valorant</span> and <span class="accent-text">Minecraft</span>, trying out new things, and talking in general. My favourite food is pizza, and I love reading and writing too.
  </p>

</div>

<style>
  .aboutCard { position:relative; overflow:hidden; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:.85rem; height:100%; min-height:0; padding:1.25rem 1.35rem; border:1px solid #f1dce5; border-radius:15px; color:var(--text); background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff0f5,#fffafd); }
  :global(.page-container) .aboutCard { justify-content:flex-start; gap:.85rem; min-height:0; padding:1.25rem 1.35rem; }
  :global(html.dark) .aboutCard { background:linear-gradient(135deg,#482c3d,#302331); border-color:#5b4052; }
  .about-topline { position:relative; z-index:2; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; gap:.6rem; }
  .about-kicker { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:.4rem; color:#bb8198; font-size:.58rem; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.13em; }
  .kicker-spark { color:#d96f9c; font-size:.9rem; }
  .availability { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:.4rem; padding:.34rem .55rem; border:1px solid #eed8e2; border-radius:999px; background:#fffafd; color:#987788; font-size:.58rem; font-weight:650; white-space:nowrap; }
  .availability i { width:6px; height:6px; border-radius:50%; background:#d8779a; box-shadow:0 0 0 3px #d8779a20; }
  :global(html.dark) .availability { background:#382a36; border-color:#604153; color:#d9c4d0; }
  .about-copy { position:relative; z-index:2; margin:0; line-height:1.65; font-size:.98rem; color:#806d7b; }
  :global(html.dark) .about-copy { color:#d0bdca; }
  .name-text { color:#503b4b; font-weight:750; }
  :global(html.dark) .name-text { color:#fff1f7; }
  .accent-text { color:#b9567e; font-weight:700; }
  :global(html.dark) .accent-text { color:#ffc2d5; }
  .subtle-text { color:#614958; font-weight:700; }
  :global(html.dark) .subtle-text { color:#fff1f7; }
  @media(max-width:460px) { .about-topline { align-items:flex-start; flex-direction:column; }:global(.page-container) .aboutCard{padding:1.1rem} }
</style>
